      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13870/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place eggs in a saucepan and cover with water. Bring to a boil, cover and remove from heat; let eggs stand in hot water for 10 to 12 minutes. Remove eggs from hot water and cool in ice water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_HwkEI8nJ6X14lyv8VUyq3muQ_g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13870-Deviled-Eggs-DDMFS-step-3-02-2fea499b2af74cff84a67dec64a2e224.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13870/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel eggs and cut in half lengthwise, remove and reserve yolks in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vvi5PX2KuW8_zdPXR7PsU6cdP9c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13870-Deviled-Eggs-DDMFS-step-5-984c9f71c3184a9ebf6fcb07f797cf19.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13870/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add mustard, salad dressing, salt, and pepper to egg yolks; mix until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
